 ends) and Pattern matching of ITS motifs of differentgeographical isolates of fasciolid species</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="97320630003314F3"/></fig><fig id="F4" position="float"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Predicted ITS2 RNA secondary structures and their structure formation enthalpies according to MFOLD</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="97320630003314F4"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>